{"municipality_code":"22205","pref":"静岡県","city":"熱海市","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"熱海市には、伊豆山村、熱海村、初島など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「田代居館跡」、「保善院」、「伊豆山神社」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、伊豆山村や熱海村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 ゆかりの人物では大野雄二や澤田政廣に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「沿岸部の親水公園の整備」や「駅ビルラスカ熱海の開業」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":477,"rank":222,"percentile":88.3,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":9,"rank":931,"percentile":48.6,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":10,"rank":1624,"percentile":11.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":22,"rank":268,"percentile":84.5,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":5,"rank":776,"percentile":53.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":6,"rank":1326,"percentile":27.8,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":1,"rank":102,"percentile":78.1,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["大野雄二","澤田政廣"],"touri